# Per-strategy bet ledgers are regenerated deterministically from the committed CSVs.
# Keeping them out of Git avoids ~5 MB of churn on every rebuild; leaderboard.json (the
# published evidence) stays tracked, and the CI job regenerates these and flags any drift.
